  "default_poll_interval": 15,
  "description": "Phocos Any-Grid PSW-H BLE telemetry and settings. Writes use allowlisted, read/compare/write/readback transactions; hardware acceptance remains unverified.",
  "notes": "Static PhocosLink 2.1.4 analysis. App-confirmed SOC, discharge and charging current. Apparent power, bus voltage and heatsink temperature are corroborated by Phocos's RS-232 command document (2020-12-14): the live block holds the same ten readings in the same order and number formats as its QPIGS reply, and the status block continues it with SOC, heatsink temperature and discharge current. PV current stays inferred: that document defines it as measured on the battery side, so PV voltage times PV current need not equal PV power. The fault bytes are still unverified. No live firmware validation.",
